Package: teachingAddins
Type: Package
Title: One-Click Render + Push for the Teaching Monorepo
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Jeremy Genette
Maintainer: Jeremy Genette <you@example.com>
Description: A single RStudio addin that runs the current course's
    scripts/render_all.sh (book + every slide deck). That script's own
    render calls trigger each course's Quarto post-render: hook, which
    commits and pushes to GitHub - so one click renders everything and
    pushes everything. Not meant for CRAN; installed locally from this
    repo with devtools::install_local().
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: rstudioapi
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
